  "description": "The Micro Ripper push bike received some awesome new upgrades this year! This lightweight micro-sized PK Ripper-styled frame now features an extended standing platform for support of those tiny feet as the rider begins to learn to balance on two wheels. Also new on the stylish frame this year is the addition of the legendary Looptail rear end, which goes hand in hand with the quintessential Landing Gear fork. The 6061 aluminum frame features an ultra-low standover height based around kid-friendly geometry. No doubt about it, the Micro Ripper is the perfect introduction for a young rider getting their first taste of the SE Bikes life.",
